{"tier":"glm-5.2","verse":21,"ref":"2-samuel 20:21","book":"2-samuel","lang":"de","chapter":20,"translation":"Nicht so ⟨ist⟩ die Sache, sondern ein Mann vom Berg Efrajim, Scheva, Sohn des Bikri, ⟨ist⟩ sein Name, hat seine Hand erhoben gegen den König, gegen Dawid. Gebt ihn, ⟨את⟩ ihn allein, und ich werde von der Stadt abziehen.\" Und die Frau sagte zu Joaw: „Siehe, sein Kopf wird zu dir hinübergeworfen ⟨durch⟩ die Mauer.","tokens":[{"surface":"לא","gloss":"Nicht"},{"surface":"כן","gloss":"so"},{"surface":"הדבר","gloss":"die Sache"},{"surface":"כי","gloss":"sondern"},{"surface":"איש","gloss":"ein Mann"},{"surface":"מהר","gloss":"vom Berg"},{"surface":"אפרים","gloss":"Efrajim"},{"surface":"שבע","gloss":"Scheva"},{"surface":"בן","gloss":"Sohn"},{"surface":"בכרי","gloss":"des Bikri"},{"surface":"שמו","gloss":"sein Name"},{"surface":"נשא","gloss":"hat erhoben"},{"surface":"ידו","gloss":"seine Hand"},{"surface":"במלך","gloss":"gegen den König"},{"surface":"בדוד","gloss":"gegen Dawid"},{"surface":"תנו","gloss":"Gebt"},{"surface":"אתו","gloss":"⟨את⟩","marks":"ihn allein"},{"surface":"לבדו","gloss":"ihn allein"},{"surface":"ואלכה","gloss":"und ich werde abziehen"},{"surface":"מעל","gloss":"von"},{"surface":"העיר","gloss":"der Stadt"},{"surface":"ותאמר","gloss":"Und ⟨sie⟩ sagte"},{"surface":"האשה","gloss":"die Frau"},{"surface":"אל","gloss":"zu"},{"surface":"יואב","gloss":"Joaw"},{"surface":"הנה","gloss":"Siehe"},{"surface":"ראשו","gloss":"sein Kopf"},{"surface":"משלך","gloss":"wird geworfen"},{"surface":"אליך","gloss":"zu dir"},{"surface":"בעד","gloss":"⟨durch⟩"},{"surface":"החומה","gloss":"die Mauer"}],"timestamp":"2026-08-06T22:39:43.233885355Z","model":"glm-5.2"}